<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PhyCor started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PhyCor started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it started coverage of PhyCor Inc as buy and a 12-month price target of $38.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 11/16 to 31-5/8.</p>
